{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370080/extras/13337193af436897aea9351a55236354.avif?t=1768428416\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370080/extras_big/13337193af436897aea9351a55236354.avif?t=1768428416 width=800 height=136 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Disco Bear \u2013 Your Funky, Endless Groove Adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the spotlight and feel the rhythm!<br>In <strong>Disco Bear</strong>, you\u2019ll tap, dance, and shine your way through a nonstop party of lights, music, and joy. Watch your disco empire grow as your bear brings happiness to every beat. From tiny dance floors to glowing galaxies, the groove never ends.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc83 <strong>Tap &amp; Dance</strong> \u2013 Every click fills the floor with rhythm, lights, and energy.<br>\u2728 <strong>Upgrade Your Style</strong> \u2013 Unlock outfits, stages, and special effects that sparkle with personality.<br>\ud83c\udfb6 <strong>Feel the Beat</strong> \u2013 Enjoy cheerful music, vibrant visuals, and the thrill of endless disco fun.<br>\ud83c\udf08 <strong>Grow Your Groove</strong> \u2013 Expand your disco world and spread happiness with every move.<br>\u267e <strong>Endless Fun</strong> \u2013 Relax, tap, and watch your bear shine brighter every time you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you want to unwind with cozy beats or chase high scores in style, <strong>Disco Bear</strong> is pure, radiant joy you\u2019ll keep coming back to.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3370080?t=1768428416","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3370080?t=1768428416","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_